      "journal": "physical review research",
      "publisher": "American Physical Society (APS)",
      "abstract": "We establish non-Hermitian topological mechanics in one-dimensional (1D) and 2D lattices consisting of mass points connected by metabeams that lead to odd elasticity. Extended from the \"non-Hermitian skin effect\" in 1D systems, we demonstrate this effect in 2D lattices in which bulk elastic waves ex...",
