          "targetDoi": "10.1016/j.aop.2005.04.011",
          "snippet": "Besides the bulk modes, on lattice boundaries we observe additional localized modes whose eigenvalues are not separated from the bulk band. These nontopological localized modes may be essential for the in-band boundary softness in energy nonconserving systems such as biological structures [104][105][106][107][108]. We leave non-Hermitian mechanics of amorphous systems in future research.",
          "section": "introduction",
