          "targetDoi": "10.1126/science.aab0239",
          "snippet": "3, where Under periodic boundary conditions, we simply convert particle displacements to momentum space by replacing β i with e iq i , q i ∈ [0, 2π ) in Eqs. (2) and (25) to obtain a non-Hermitian dynamical matrix.",
          "section": "a non-hermitian topological mechanics in the 1d rotor chain",
